<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC's monthly maize estimates (July/June, million tonnes). *Revisions for 95/96.</p>
<p>			   96/97(Jan) 96/97 (Dec)     95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	 1.653     1.653	     1.671</p>
<p> Harvested crop	13.997    13.997	    12.394</p>
<p> Use on farms	   2.017     2.017	     1.956</p>
<p> Other domestic use   3.378     3.378	     2.983</p>
<p>  - incl. animal feed 2.300     2.300	     1.917</p>
<p> Exports to EU	  5.920     5.920	     6.087</p>
<p> Non-EU exports	 0.200     0.200	     0.164</p>
<p> Final stocks	   2.827     2.827	     1.653</p>
</text>
